---
import '../styles/global.css';
import '../styles/pages/privacy.css';
import '../styles/enhancements.css';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base page="privacy" hasForm={false}>
<section class="page-hero" id="top" aria-labelledby="page-title">
<div class="tech-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="wrap" style="padding-top: clamp(32px, 4vw, 56px); padding-bottom: clamp(24px, 3vw, 40px); position: relative;">
<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol class="crumbs in d1"><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><span aria-current="page">Privacy</span></li></ol></nav>
<p class="draft-flag in d1">Draft for review · not final</p>
<h1 id="page-title" class="display page-title privacy-title in d1">Privacy Policy</h1>
<p class="lede in d3">How Pascoe Performance collects, uses and protects your personal information.</p>
<p class="updated in d3">Last updated: <span class="ph-text">[set when the final policy is published]</span></p>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-label="Privacy policy" style="padding-top: 24px;">
<div class="wrap policy">
<nav class="toc glass" aria-labelledby="toc-h">
<h2 id="toc-h">On this page</h2>
<ol>
<li><a href="#who">About Pascoe Performance</a></li>
<li><a href="#officer">Privacy contact</a></li>
<li><a href="#collect">Information collected</a></li>
<li><a href="#use">How your information is used</a></li>
<li><a href="#consent">Consent</a></li>
<li><a href="#minors">Young athletes and minors</a></li>
<li><a href="#share">Sharing your information</a></li>
<li><a href="#retention">How long it is kept</a></li>
<li><a href="#safeguards">How it is protected</a></li>
<li><a href="#rights">Your rights</a></li>
<li><a href="#concerns">Questions or concerns</a></li>
<li><a href="#changes">Changes to this policy</a></li>
</ol>
</nav>
<div class="policy-body">
<section class="p-sec glass reveal" id="who" aria-labelledby="who-h">
<h2 id="who-h" class="p-h2">About Pascoe Performance</h2>
<p>Pascoe Performance <span class="ph-text">[legal business name, if different]</span> is a personal training and football performance coaching business run by Ben Pascoe in Hamilton, Ontario. This policy explains how Pascoe Performance handles personal information collected through this website <span class="ph-text">[CONFIRM: and whether it also covers client records kept during coaching]</span>.</p>
<p>In Canada, the <em>Personal Information Protection and Electronic Documents Act</em> (PIPEDA) sets rules for how private-sector organizations handle personal information in the course of commercial activities. Pascoe Performance aims to handle personal information in line with those rules.</p>
</section>
<section class="p-sec glass reveal" id="officer" aria-labelledby="officer-h">
<h2 id="officer-h" class="p-h2">Privacy contact</h2>
<p>Ben Pascoe is responsible for how Pascoe Performance handles personal information. For any privacy question or request, contact:</p>
<ul><li>Email: <span class="ph-text">[PRIVACY EMAIL]</span></li><li>Phone: <span class="ph-text">[CONTACT PHONE]</span></li></ul>
</section>
<section class="p-sec glass reveal" id="collect" aria-labelledby="collect-h">
<h2 id="collect-h" class="p-h2">Information collected</h2>
<h3>When you send an inquiry</h3>
<p>The inquiry form asks for:</p>
<ul><li>Your name and email address (required)</li><li>The training you are interested in (required)</li><li>Your phone number and a short message (optional)</li></ul>
<p>Please do not include medical records, health details or other sensitive information in the form.</p>
<h3>When you train with Ben</h3>
<p><span class="ph-text">[CONFIRM: what information is collected from clients during coaching, how it is recorded, and whether this policy covers it]</span></p>
<h3>When you visit the website</h3>
<p><span class="ph-text">[CONFIRM: what the hosting provider logs (for example, IP addresses), and whether the live site uses analytics, cookies, other storage or embedded content such as video players]</span></p>
</section>
<section class="p-sec glass reveal" id="use" aria-labelledby="use-h">
<h2 id="use-h" class="p-h2">How your information is used</h2>
<ul><li>To respond to your inquiry and discuss training options</li><li>If you become a client, to plan and deliver your training <span class="ph-text">[CONFIRM: client uses]</span></li><li>To meet legal, accounting and record-keeping obligations</li></ul>
<p><span class="ph-text">[CONFIRM: that personal information is never sold or rented]</span> Your information is used only for these purposes, or for a new purpose with your consent.</p>
</section>
<section class="p-sec glass reveal" id="consent" aria-labelledby="consent-h">
<h2 id="consent-h" class="p-h2">Consent</h2>
<p>By sending an inquiry, you agree to Pascoe Performance using your information to respond to it. Sending an inquiry does not sign you up for marketing messages.</p>
<p><span class="ph-text">[CONFIRM: whether marketing emails or texts will ever be offered; if so, describe how people opt in and unsubscribe]</span></p>
<p>You can withdraw your consent at any time by contacting Pascoe Performance, subject to legal or contractual limits. Withdrawing consent may affect Ben's ability to coach you.</p>
</section>
<section class="p-sec glass reveal" id="minors" aria-labelledby="minors-h">
<h2 id="minors-h" class="p-h2">Young athletes and minors</h2>
<p>Pascoe Performance's policy is that for anyone under 18, a parent or legal guardian should send the inquiry for them, using their own name and contact details. This applies to both personal training and football training. <span class="ph-text">[CONFIRM: this age and policy]</span></p>
<p>Please do not include a young person's identifying, school or medical information in the form. <span class="ph-text">[CONFIRM: what happens if a young person sends an inquiry directly]</span></p>
</section>
<section class="p-sec glass reveal" id="share" aria-labelledby="share-h">
<h2 id="share-h" class="p-h2">Sharing your information</h2>
<p>Pascoe Performance shares personal information only when needed to run its services, when you consent, or when required by law. Service providers help operate this website and its communications:</p>
<ul><li>Website hosting: <span class="ph-text">[HOSTING PROVIDER]</span></li><li>Form and email delivery: <span class="ph-text">[FORM / EMAIL PROVIDER]</span></li></ul>
<p><span class="ph-text">[CONFIRM: where these providers store data, including whether it may be outside Canada, and what agreements are in place with them]</span></p>
<p>Personal training sessions take place at Anytime Fitness, a separate business with its own privacy practices. <span class="ph-text">[CONFIRM: whether any client information is shared with the gym]</span></p>
</section>
<section class="p-sec glass reveal" id="retention" aria-labelledby="retention-h">
<h2 id="retention-h" class="p-h2">How long it is kept</h2>
<p><span class="ph-text">[OWNER TO SET: how long inquiries that do not lead to training are kept]</span></p>
<p><span class="ph-text">[OWNER TO SET: how long client records are kept, and how they are deleted]</span></p>
</section>
<section class="p-sec glass reveal" id="safeguards" aria-labelledby="safeguards-h">
<h2 id="safeguards-h" class="p-h2">How it is protected</h2>
<p><span class="ph-text">[CONFIRM: how information is stored (for example, which email and file services), who has access, and whether any paper records are kept]</span></p>
<p>PIPEDA requires organizations to report breaches of security safeguards that create a real risk of significant harm to the Office of the Privacy Commissioner of Canada and to notify affected individuals. Pascoe Performance will follow those requirements.</p>
</section>
<section class="p-sec glass reveal" id="rights" aria-labelledby="rights-h">
<h2 id="rights-h" class="p-h2">Your rights</h2>
<ul><li>Ask what personal information Pascoe Performance holds about you and how it is used</li><li>Request access to your information</li><li>Ask for information that is inaccurate or incomplete to be corrected</li><li>Withdraw your consent</li></ul>
<p>Contact Pascoe Performance to make a request. You will receive a response within the time PIPEDA allows, generally 30 days. In limited circumstances that time can be extended, and you will be told if it is. Your identity may need to be confirmed first.</p>
</section>
<section class="p-sec glass reveal" id="concerns" aria-labelledby="concerns-h">
<h2 id="concerns-h" class="p-h2">Questions or concerns</h2>
<p>Please contact Pascoe Performance first so your concern can be resolved directly if possible. You can also contact the <a href="https://www.priv.gc.ca/">Office of the Privacy Commissioner of Canada</a>.</p>
</section>
<section class="p-sec glass reveal" id="changes" aria-labelledby="changes-h">
<h2 id="changes-h" class="p-h2">Changes to this policy</h2>
<p>This policy may be updated when practices change. The date at the top shows when it was last updated.</p>
</section>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</Base>
